      en: ["The building was constructed around the year 1907.", "Located on Shark Street in the heart of Lüderitz.", "Designed in the German Heimatstil with Art Nouveau decorative touches.", "It was one of the first hotels in the region to offer running water.", "The town of Lüderitz was founded in 1883 by Adolf Lüderitz.", "The facade features characteristic bay windows and ornamental gables."],
